OL,5,G0350 Long Lost Family
OL,6,     FPaula's baby's father disappeared
OL,7,     Fwhen she discovered she was
OL,8,     Fpregnant in 1979. Unable to
OL,9,     Fsupport herself, Paula felt that
OL,10,     Fadoption was the only option, but
OL,11,     Falways questioned her choice. The
OL,12,     Fsecond case features Justus
OL,13,     FAugustin, who came to London from
OL,14,     FSt Lucia in the 1960s. He fell in
OL,15,     Flove with a white Irish girl who
OL,16,     Fbecame pregnant. Her father
OL,17,     Fdisapproved of the relationship,
OL,18,     Fand insisted the baby must be put
OL,19,     Fup for adoption. Unsuccessful in
OL,20,     Fhis efforts to be allowed to raise
OL,21,     Fhis daughter, Justus has yearned
OL,22,     Fto find her ever since
